    github_url: 'https://github.com/Heysh1n/5whys-architect',
    markdown_description: `# AI Agent Skill: 5Whys Architect

A root-cause analysis skill for Codex, Claude Code, and Antigravity.

It walks the agent through five iterative "why" checks before editing code, so fixes target the real cause instead of symptoms. Works for single-agent debugging, swarm reviews, and incident triage.`,
  },
  {
