    cta_label: 'Перейти на GitHub',
    cta_url: 'https://github.com/Heysh1n/sfc',
    github_url: 'https://github.com/Heysh1n/sfc',
    markdown_description: `# Smart File Collector (SFC)

Python 3 CLI utility with zero external dependencies. Lets you pick files in an interactive terminal tree, strip extra whitespace or comments, and export a structured code bundle for an AI prompt.`,
  },
